(module aslHarness/tests/residentLayerTest :x [testPipelineOrdering testResidentTranslatorMultilingualTurn testResidentTranslatorIncompatibleFallback testStepMiddlewareTurnInterceptor testCodeSwitchingIntentExtraction runTests] :i [(aslAgentCore/onion :a on) (stepMiddleware :a sm) (aslHarness/onion/middleware :a omw) (promptTranslator :a pt)])

fn testPipelineOrdering -> Bool
  (let [(pipe (omw/createHarnessPipeline)) (sorted pipe.sorted) (cnt (listLength sorted)) (m0 (optionOr (listHead sorted) (on/makeMiddleware "" "" (on/kindPreCall) 0 (list) (list)))) (tail1 (optionOr (listTail sorted) (list))) (m1 (optionOr (listHead tail1) (on/makeMiddleware "" "" (on/kindPreCall) 0 (list) (list)))) (tail2 (optionOr (listTail tail1) (list))) (m2 (optionOr (listHead tail2) (on/makeMiddleware "" "" (on/kindFilter) 0 (list) (list)))) (tail3 (optionOr (listTail tail2) (list))) (m3 (optionOr (listHead tail3) (on/makeMiddleware "" "" (on/kindAudit) 0 (list) (list))))] (do (assert (>= cnt 4) "Pipeline must contain at least 4 middlewares") (assert (= m0.id "mw-resident-translator") "First middleware must be resident translator") (assert (= m0.priority 50) "Resident translator priority must be 50") (assert (= m1.id "mw-cache") "Second middleware must be prompt cache") (assert (= m1.priority 100) "Cache priority must be 100") (assert (= m2.id "mw-grounding") "Third middleware must be grounding firewall") (assert (= m2.priority 200) "Grounding priority must be 200") (assert (= m3.id "mw-audit") "Fourth middleware must be audit logger") (assert (= m3.priority 500) "Audit priority must be 500") true))

fn testResidentTranslatorMultilingualTurn -> Bool
  (let [(mixedInput "Пожалуйста, задеплой фикс и проверь buffer leak в VFS.\n- Run asl gate\n- Verify zero comments") (cfg (pt/makeTranslationConfig true true true "qwen-2.5-3b")) (res (pt/translatePrompt mixedInput cfg))] (do (assert res.translated "Mixed language turn must translate successfully") (assert (not res.fallbackUsed) "Compatible model must not trigger fallback") (assert (stringStartsWith? res.formattedPrompt "(:prompt") "Output must be valid ASN S-expression") (assert (stringContains? res.formattedPrompt ":intent") "Output must encapsulate intent") (assert (stringContains? res.formattedPrompt ":directives") "Directives list must be populated") (assert (stringContains? res.formattedPrompt ":reasoning-frame") "Reasoning frame must be injected") (assert (> res.tokensSavedPct 0.0) "Token savings percentage must be greater than zero") true))

fn testResidentTranslatorIncompatibleFallback -> Bool
  (let [(rawPrompt "Проверь утечку памяти в WebSocket соединении") (cfg (pt/makeTranslationConfig true true false "smollm2-135m")) (res (pt/translatePrompt rawPrompt cfg))] (do (assert (not res.translated) "Translation flag must be false for incompatible model") (assert res.fallbackUsed "Fallback used flag must be true") (assert (= res.reason ":incompatible-model-fallback") "Reason must indicate model incompatibility") (assert (= res.formattedPrompt rawPrompt) "Prompt content must be preserved unmodified") (assert (= res.tokensSavedPct 0.0) "Zero token savings on fallback") true))

fn testStepMiddlewareTurnInterceptor -> Bool
  (let [(turn "Execute master audit plan and verify all packages") (formatted (sm/processTurnInputWithResidentTranslator turn "qwen-2.5-3b"))] (do (assert (stringStartsWith? formatted "(:prompt") "Formatted turn must be structured ASN") (assert (stringContains? formatted ":intent \"Execute master audit plan") "Intent must be extracted") (assert (stringContains? formatted ":context") "Context must be set") true))

fn testCodeSwitchingIntentExtraction -> Bool
  (let [(mixed "Сделай refactor для voice gateway и проверь latency bounds") (cfg (pt/makeTranslationConfig true true false "gemini-2.5-flash")) (res (pt/translatePrompt mixed cfg))] (do (assert res.translated "Code switching input must be recognized and translated") (assert (stringContains? res.formattedPrompt "voice gateway") "Technical terms must remain verbatim") (assert (stringContains? res.formattedPrompt "latency bounds") "Technical metrics must remain verbatim") true))

fn runTests -> Bool
  (and (testPipelineOrdering) (and (testResidentTranslatorMultilingualTurn) (and (testResidentTranslatorIncompatibleFallback) (and (testStepMiddlewareTurnInterceptor) (testCodeSwitchingIntentExtraction)))))
